# do not delete me
#
# Git tracks files, not directories, so this directory would vanish from
# the next clone without a file in it. This is that file. It ignores
# nothing on purpose — see `keepMarker` in schemas/cat-harness.ts.
#
# subscriptions/
# The root declaration of each Knowledge Graph this instance subscribes to,
# cached at the pinned commit: one `<id>.substrate.json` per `subscriptions`
# entry, holding the upstream bytes, their sha256, and the harnesses and
# subgraphs the substrate offers. Written by `bun run kg:subscribe`; never
# edited by hand.
